# Command Code's plan usage, in its usage panel.

## Setup: how to find each value the provider reads. Setting names,
## environment variables, URLs, cookie and header names, and the
## service's own menu paths stay as written.

usage-commandcode-setting-cookie = Sign in to https://commandcode.ai, open Developer Tools > Application > Cookies for https://commandcode.ai, and copy the session cookie: __Secure-better-auth.session_token (or __Secure-commandcode_prod_.session_token, whichever is present). Paste it as "name=value".
